    "title": "v2.order.download_fbs_invoices",
    "version": "V2",
    "description": "This API allows you to download FBS invoices. To use this API, the client must first call v2.order.generate_fbs_invoices to create a new shipping document task, followed by calling v2.order.get_fbs_invoices_result to check the task status. The document can only be downloaded once the task status is \"READY.\""
